{
  "id": "5a222bc71ad3",
  "title": "Introducing agentic video understanding with Gemini",
  "originalTitle": "Introducing agentic video understanding with Gemini",
  "source": "Google DeepMind",
  "category": "Tech",
  "url": "https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/models-and-research/gemini-models/introducing-agentic-video-in-gemini/",
  "publishedAt": "2026-09-01T17:08:51.000Z",
  "content": "<div id=\"readability-page-1\" class=\"page\"><article> <div data-analytics-module=\"{ &quot;module_name&quot;: &quot;Hero Menu&quot;, &quot;section_header&quot;: &quot;Introducing agentic video understanding with Gemini&quot; }\"> <div> <div> <p> Our new agentic feature for video analysis cuts token consumption by up to 88%, reduces costs by up to 66%, and boosts quality by up to 7%. </p> </div> <hr> <div> <p>Mario Lučić</p> <p>Research Director, Google DeepMind</p> </div> <hr> </div> <div> <p><img alt=\"Text &quot;Agentic video understanding&quot; next to the Gemini logo, all on a dark blue background\" data-component=\"uni-progressive-image\" fetchpriority=\"high\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/agentic-video___keyword__blog-hea.width-200.format-webp.webp\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 1023px) 100vw, (max-width: 1440px) 95vw, 1408px\" data-srcset=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/agentic-video___keyword__blog-hea.width-450.format-webp.webp 450w, https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/agentic-video___keyword__blog-hea.width-900.format-webp.webp 900w, https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/agentic-video___keyword__blog-he.width-1200.format-webp.webp 1200w, https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/agentic-video___keyword__blog-he.width-1600.format-webp.webp 1600w, https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/agentic-video___keyword__blog-he.width-2200.format-webp.webp 2200w\"> </p> </div> </div> <div data-component=\"uni-audio-player-tts\" uni-l10n=\"{ &quot;stop&quot;: &quot;Pause article audio description&quot;, &quot;play&quot;: &quot;Play article audio description&quot;, &quot;progress&quot;: &quot;Current audio progress minutes with seconds: [[progress]]&quot;, &quot;duration&quot;: &quot;Duration of the audio minutes with seconds: [[duration]]&quot;, &quot;settings&quot;: &quot;Click for settings&quot;, &quot;timeText&quot;: &quot;[[duration]] minutes&quot; }\" data-analytics-module=\"{ &quot;module_name&quot;: &quot;Audio TTS&quot;, &quot;section_header&quot;: &quot;Introducing agentic video understanding with Gemini&quot; }\" data-tts-audios=\"[ {&quot;voice_name&quot;: &quot;Umbriel&quot;, &quot;voice_source&quot;: &quot;https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/media/tts_audio_86108_umbriel_2026_09_01_17_44_39.mp3&quot;, &quot;mimetype&quot;: &quot;audio/mpeg&quot;}, {&quot;voice_name&quot;: &quot;Gacrux&quot;, &quot;voice_source&quot;: &quot;https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/media/tts_audio_86108_gacrux_2026_09_01_17_44_35.mp3&quot;, &quot;mimetype&quot;: &quot;audio/mpeg&quot;} ]\"> <p><audio title=\"Introducing agentic video understanding with Gemini\"> <source src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/media/tts_audio_86108_umbriel_2026_09_01_17_44_39.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\"> <p>Your browser does not support the audio element.</p> </audio></p><div aria-label=\"\"> <p><span> Listen to article </span></p><p>[[duration]] minutes</p> <p><span tabindex=\"0\" role=\"tooltip\" aria-label=\"This content is generated by Google AI. Generative AI is experimental\"> <p>This content is generated by Google AI. Generative AI is experimental</p> <svg> <use xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" href=\"/static/blogv2/images/icons.svg?version=pr20260820-1820#ttf-info\"></use>\n</svg> </span> </p></div>\n</div> <div data-reading-time=\"true\" data-component=\"uni-article-body\"> <!--article text--> <section data-analytics-module=\"{ &quot;module_name&quot;: &quot;Paragraph&quot;, &quot;section_header&quot;: &quot;Introducing agentic video understanding with Gemini&quot; }\"> <uni-article-paragraph> <div><p data-block-key=\"xsvr3\">Today, we’re launching <a href=\"https://ai.google.dev/gemini-api/docs/video-understanding#agentic-video-understanding\">agentic video understanding</a> across our latest models: Gemini 3.7 Flash, 3.6 Flash and 3.5 Flash-Lite. This new capability improves accuracy while dramatically reducing token usage and costs for video analysis. Similar to <a href=\"https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/technology/developers-tools/agentic-vision-gemini-3-flash/\">agentic vision</a>, which combines code execution with Gemini models’ native image understanding, agentic video understanding uses Gemini’s native video tools to improve performance and unlock new capabilities for video processing like sub-second moment retrieval, more accurate anomaly detection, precise counting and more.</p><p data-block-key=\"e2os0\">The feature is available today for video uploads and YouTube videos via the Gemini API in Google AI Studio and the Gemini Enterprise Agent Platform.</p><h2 data-block-key=\"ab9hu\">Benchmarks</h2><p data-block-key=\"dedeo\">Unlike current ‘static’ processing, where the model ingests the video at a fixed frames-per-second rate (default 1 FPS, adjustable via API), agentic video understanding pairs the model’s core reasoning with native video tools to dynamically search, scan, and inspect target video segments across visual frames, audio, and transcripts. Across standard video analysis benchmarks, Gemini models with agentic video understanding <b>reduce analysis costs by up to 66% and token consumption by up to 88%, while improving accuracy by up to 7%.</b></p><p data-block-key=\"6p6eh\">These efficiency gains are especially pronounced on long-form video (from 10-minute how-to guides to 90-minute lectures and multi-hour recordings), where static processing forces developers to choose between high token costs or techniques that drop critical details.</p></div> </uni-article-paragraph>\n</section> <section data-component=\"uni-inline-image\"> <uni-inline-image alignment=\"full\" alt-text=\"Graphs analyzing token efficiency and accuracy gains\" external-image=\"\" or-mp4-video-title=\"\" or-mp4-video-url=\"\" section-header=\"Introducing agentic video understanding with Gemini\" external-link=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/agentic-video__evals.original.png\" autoplay=\"true\"> <div slot=\"caption-slot\"> <p data-block-key=\"ybo46\">Activating agentic video understanding drops token consumption by up to 88% and boosts accuracy by up to 7% with Gemini 3.7 Flash.</p> </div> <p><img alt=\"Graphs analyzing token efficiency and accuracy gains\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/agentic-video__evals.width-1200.format-webp.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 80vw, 1200px\" srcset=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/agentic-video__evals.width-500.format-webp.webp 500w, https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/agentic-video__evals.width-800.format-webp.webp 800w, https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/agentic-video__evals.width-1200.format-webp.webp 1200w, https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/agentic-video__evals.width-1600.format-webp.webp 1600w, https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/agentic-video__evals.width-2000.format-webp.webp 2000w\"> </p> </uni-inline-image>\n</section> <section data-analytics-module=\"{ &quot;module_name&quot;: &quot;Paragraph&quot;, &quot;section_header&quot;: &quot;Introducing agentic video understanding with Gemini&quot; }\"> <uni-article-paragraph> <p data-block-key=\"xsvr3\">While these gains span all three supported models, Gemini 3.7 Flash with agentic understanding offers the best possible quality overall and the best combination of quality and cost efficiency, putting it at the accuracy-to-cost pareto frontier among tested models for video understanding.</p> </uni-article-paragraph>\n</section> <section data-component=\"uni-inline-image\"> <uni-inline-image alignment=\"full\" alt-text=\"Graph with &quot;Cost per query&quot; on the x-axis and &quot;Accuracy&quot; on the y-axis\" external-image=\"\" or-mp4-video-title=\"\" or-mp4-video-url=\"\" section-header=\"Introducing agentic video understanding with Gemini\" external-link=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/agentic-video__evals_table2.original.png\" autoplay=\"true\"> <div slot=\"caption-slot\"> <p data-block-key=\"ybo46\">Using agentic video understanding places Gemini 3.7 Flash at the accuracy-to-cost pareto frontier for video analysis.</p> </div> <p><img alt=\"Graph with &quot;Cost per query&quot; on the x-axis and &quot;Accuracy&quot; on the y-axis\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/agentic-video__evals_table2.width-1200.format-webp.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 80vw, 1200px\" srcset=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/agentic-video__evals_table2.width-500.format-webp.webp 500w, https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/agentic-video__evals_table2.width-800.format-webp.webp 800w, https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/agentic-video__evals_table2.width-1200.format-webp.webp 1200w, https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/agentic-video__evals_table2.width-1600.format-webp.webp 1600w, https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/agentic-video__evals_table2.width-2000.format-webp.webp 2000w\"> </p> </uni-inline-image>\n</section> <section data-analytics-module=\"{ &quot;module_name&quot;: &quot;Paragraph&quot;, &quot;section_header&quot;: &quot;Introducing agentic video understanding with Gemini&quot; }\"> <uni-article-paragraph> <div><h2 data-block-key=\"xsvr3\">How it works</h2><p data-block-key=\"m944\">Instead of static processing where the model ingests media streams at a fixed frame rate, agentic video understanding enables Gemini to take an active, goal-directed role in determining <i>what</i> to watch, at <i>what</i> speed, and through <i>which</i> modality (frames, audio, or transcript), fetching only the moments and signals needed. While developers could previously do this manually, with agentic video understanding, Gemini can accomplish it through an agentic loop, invoking an internal tool to load the relevant part of the video file, significantly reducing development overheads.</p></div> </uni-article-paragraph>\n</section> <section data-component=\"uni-inline-image\"> <uni-inline-image alignment=\"full\" alt-text=\"Diagram of the process from Query to Output\" external-image=\"\" or-mp4-video-title=\"\" or-mp4-video-url=\"\" section-header=\"Introducing agentic video understanding with Gemini\" autoplay=\"true\"> <p><img alt=\"Diagram of the process from Query to Output\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/agentic-video__diagram.width-1200.format-webp.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 80vw, 1200px\" srcset=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/agentic-video__diagram.width-500.format-webp.webp 500w, https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/agentic-video__diagram.width-800.format-webp.webp 800w, https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/agentic-video__diagram.width-1200.format-webp.webp 1200w, https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/agentic-video__diagram.width-1600.format-webp.webp 1600w, https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/agentic-video__diagram.width-2000.format-webp.webp 2000w\"> </p> </uni-inline-image>\n</section> <section data-analytics-module=\"{ &quot;module_name&quot;: &quot;Paragraph&quot;, &quot;section_header&quot;: &quot;Introducing agentic video understanding with Gemini&quot; }\"> <uni-article-paragraph> <div><h2 data-block-key=\"xsvr3\">Capabilities and use cases</h2><p data-block-key=\"31ruh\">Agentic video understanding transforms how developers can process long-form video content across a variety of demanding applications.</p><ul><li data-block-key=\"ado4f\"><b>Sub-second moment retrieval</b>: Pinpoint split-second state changes and tight cut boundaries that are easily missed at 1 FPS, making precise automated video editing possible.</li><li data-block-key=\"1qlqt\"><b>Long-form needle-in-a-haystack search</b>: Answer complex queries across multi-hour videos without consuming millions of tokens.</li><li data-block-key=\"4emfi\"><b>Anomaly detection</b>: Resample interesting time windows at higher FPS to inspect rapid motion and subtle visual artifacts.</li><li data-block-key=\"f64tr\"><b>Counting action &amp; object</b>: Accurately track repeated physical movements and distinct objects over time.</li></ul></div> </uni-article-paragraph>\n</section> <section data-analytics-module=\"{ &quot;module_name&quot;: &quot;Media Carousel&quot;, &quot;section_header&quot;: &quot;Introducing agentic video understanding with Gemini&quot; }\"> <uni-media-carousel data-shape-context-provider=\"\"> <uni-media-carousel-viewport slot=\"viewport\"> <uni-media-carousel-slide data-theme=\"blue\" shapes=\"[&quot;4-sided-cookie&quot;, &quot;bun&quot;, &quot;square&quot;]\" data-index=\"0\" accordion-header=\"Token-efficient long-form video analysisSee how Gemini 3.7 Flash performs with and without agentic video understanding on LongVideoBench, a long-form video understanding benchmark. Notice the large token reductions and accuracy improvements.\"> </uni-media-carousel-slide> <uni-media-carousel-slide data-theme=\"blue\" shapes=\"[&quot;4-sided-cookie&quot;, &quot;bun&quot;, &quot;square&quot;]\" data-index=\"1\" accordion-header=\"Accurate fast action analysis with dynamic FPSWith agentic video understanding, 3.7 Flash is able to accurately count a fast-paced movement by scanning and rewatching the video at different frames per second, as needed.\"> </uni-media-carousel-slide> <uni-media-carousel-slide data-theme=\"blue\" shapes=\"[&quot;4-sided-cookie&quot;, &quot;bun&quot;, &quot;square&quot;]\" data-index=\"2\" accordion-header=\"Token-efficient needle-in-a-haystack searchUsing agentic video understanding, Gemini 3.7 is able to accurately answer complex questions based on the content of the video while consuming a significantly lower number of tokens compared to static analysis.\"> </uni-media-carousel-slide> </uni-media-carousel-viewport> </uni-media-carousel>\n</section> <section data-analytics-module=\"{ &quot;module_name&quot;: &quot;Paragraph&quot;, &quot;section_header&quot;: &quot;Introducing agentic video understanding with Gemini&quot; }\"> <uni-article-paragraph> <div><h2 data-block-key=\"yp63o\">Real-world results</h2><p data-block-key=\"5ar2h\">Many of our early access partners saw strong performance while testing with agentic video understanding. Here’s what they have to say:</p></div> </uni-article-paragraph>\n</section> <section data-analytics-module=\"{ &quot;module_name&quot;: &quot;Media Carousel&quot;, &quot;section_header&quot;: &quot;Introducing agentic video understanding with Gemini&quot; }\"> <uni-media-carousel data-shape-context-provider=\"\"> <uni-media-carousel-viewport slot=\"viewport\"> <uni-media-carousel-slide data-theme=\"blue\" shapes=\"[&quot;4-sided-cookie&quot;, &quot;bun&quot;, &quot;square&quot;]\" data-index=\"0\" accordion-header=\"\"> <div slot=\"content\"> <uni-media data-analytics-module=\"{ &quot;module_name&quot;: &quot;Media Carousel/Image&quot;, &quot;section_header&quot;: &quot;Introducing agentic video understanding with Gemini&quot; }\" or-mp4-video-url=\"\" section-header=\"Introducing agentic video understanding with Gemini\" alt-text=\"Quote from Ponder\" video-title=\"\" autoplay=\"true\"> <p><img alt=\"Quote from Ponder\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/agentic-video-understanding__test.width-100.format-webp.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" data-loading=\"{ &quot;mobile&quot;: &quot;https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/agentic-video-understanding__test.width-500.format-webp.webp&quot;, &quot;desktop&quot;: &quot;https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/agentic-video-understanding__tes.width-1000.format-webp.webp&quot; }\"> </p> </uni-media> </div> </uni-media-carousel-slide> <uni-media-carousel-slide data-theme=\"blue\" shapes=\"[&quot;4-sided-cookie&quot;, &quot;bun&quot;, &quot;square&quot;]\" data-index=\"1\" accordion-header=\"\"> <div slot=\"content\"> <uni-media data-analytics-module=\"{ &quot;module_name&quot;: &quot;Media Carousel/Image&quot;, &quot;section_header&quot;: &quot;Introducing agentic video understanding with Gemini&quot; }\" or-mp4-video-url=\"\" section-header=\"Introducing agentic video understanding with Gemini\" alt-text=\"Quote from Revyl\" video-title=\"\" autoplay=\"true\"> <p><img alt=\"Quote from Revyl\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/agentic-video-understanding__test.width-100.format-webp_IH5FVna.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" data-loading=\"{ &quot;mobile&quot;: &quot;https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/agentic-video-understanding__test.width-500.format-webp_ftfaloY.webp&quot;, &quot;desktop&quot;: &quot;https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/agentic-video-understanding__tes.width-1000.format-webp_cCrFcWZ.webp&quot; }\"> </p> </uni-media> </div> </uni-media-carousel-slide> <uni-media-carousel-slide data-theme=\"blue\" shapes=\"[&quot;4-sided-cookie&quot;, &quot;bun&quot;, &quot;square&quot;]\" data-index=\"2\" accordion-header=\"\"> <div slot=\"content\"> <uni-media data-analytics-module=\"{ &quot;module_name&quot;: &quot;Media Carousel/Image&quot;, &quot;section_header&quot;: &quot;Introducing agentic video understanding with Gemini&quot; }\" or-mp4-video-url=\"\" section-header=\"Introducing agentic video understanding with Gemini\" alt-text=\"Quote from Mosaic\" video-title=\"\" autoplay=\"true\"> <p><img alt=\"Quote from Mosaic\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/agentic-video-understanding__test.width-100.format-webp_JwIFAZ5.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" data-loading=\"{ &quot;mobile&quot;: &quot;https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/agentic-video-understanding__test.width-500.format-webp_vjHOv9X.webp&quot;, &quot;desktop&quot;: &quot;https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/agentic-video-understanding__tes.width-1000.format-webp_hsgmVv0.webp&quot; }\"> </p> </uni-media> </div> </uni-media-carousel-slide> <uni-media-carousel-slide data-theme=\"blue\" shapes=\"[&quot;4-sided-cookie&quot;, &quot;bun&quot;, &quot;square&quot;]\" data-index=\"3\" accordion-header=\"\"> <div slot=\"content\"> <uni-media data-analytics-module=\"{ &quot;module_name&quot;: &quot;Media Carousel/Image&quot;, &quot;section_header&quot;: &quot;Introducing agentic video understanding with Gemini&quot; }\" or-mp4-video-url=\"\" section-header=\"Introducing agentic video understanding with Gemini\" alt-text=\"Quote from Resemble.AI\" video-title=\"\" autoplay=\"true\"> <p><img alt=\"Quote from Resemble.AI\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/agentic-video-understanding__test.width-100.format-webp_HHQ7484.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" data-loading=\"{ &quot;mobile&quot;: &quot;https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/agentic-video-understanding__test.width-500.format-webp_QiRmq1q.webp&quot;, &quot;desktop&quot;: &quot;https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/agentic-video-understanding__tes.width-1000.format-webp_gnoXZEz.webp&quot; }\"> </p> </uni-media> </div> </uni-media-carousel-slide> </uni-media-carousel-viewport> </uni-media-carousel>\n</section> <section data-analytics-module=\"{ &quot;module_name&quot;: &quot;Paragraph&quot;, &quot;section_header&quot;: &quot;Introducing agentic video understanding with Gemini&quot; }\"> <uni-article-paragraph> <div><h2 data-block-key=\"kv511\">Getting started</h2><p data-block-key=\"7t9pe\">Agentic video understanding is available via the Gemini API in <a href=\"https://ai.google.dev/gemini-api/docs/video-understanding#agentic-video-understanding\">Google AI Studio</a> and <a href=\"https://docs.cloud.google.com/gemini-enterprise-agent-platform/models/capabilities/video-understanding\">Gemini Enterprise Agent Platform</a>, launching across Gemini 3.7 Flash, 3.6 Flash, and 3.5 Flash-Lite. It uses standard Gemini API token pricing with no additional feature fee.</p><p data-block-key=\"eo4p7\">To enable it, simply set processing to \"agentic\" in the API configuration. Read our <a href=\"http://ai.dev/learn/agentic-video-understanding-with-gemini\">developer guide</a> to get more insights into the feature and how to get started.</p></div> </uni-article-paragraph>\n</section> <div aria-label=\"Code to get started with agentic video understanding\" data-component=\"uni-code-block\" data-analytics-module=\"{ &quot;module_name&quot;: &quot;Code Block&quot;, &quot;section_header&quot;: &quot;Introducing agentic video understanding with Gemini&quot; }\" data-tooltip-text=\"Copied\" data-lang=\"py\" description=\"Code to get started with agentic video understanding\"> <pre><code>from google import genai\n\nclient = genai.Client()\n\ninteraction = client.interactions.create( model=\"gemini-3.7-flash\", input=[ { \"type\": \"video\", \"uri\": \"https://youtu.be/7Z5Vy9JBANs\", \"processing\": \"agentic\" }, { \"type\": \"text\", \"text\": \"What are the 3 most important announcements in this keynote?\", }, ],\n)\n\nprint(interaction.output_text)</code></pre> </div> <section data-analytics-module=\"{ &quot;module_name&quot;: &quot;Paragraph&quot;, &quot;section_header&quot;: &quot;Introducing agentic video understanding with Gemini&quot; }\"> <uni-article-paragraph> <div><p data-block-key=\"kv511\">We are also bringing the efficiency and quality improvements of agentic video understanding to billions of users across Google products. The feature will roll out to all users in the Gemini app across Flash and Flash-Lite models soon. And in the coming months, agentic video understanding will also power YouTube's ‘<a href=\"https://support.google.com/youtube/answer/14110396?hl=en&amp;co=GENIE.Platform%3DAndroid\">Ask YouTube’</a> feature on the video watch page, leveraging Gemini to deliver higher-quality answers grounded in the visuals.</p><p data-block-key=\"6f4l8\"><b><i>Acknowledgement for their contribution to this work:</i></b> <i>Sergi Caelles, Filip Pavetić, Ahmet Iscen, Suhas Yogin, and the Agentic Vision team.</i></p></div> </uni-article-paragraph>\n</section> <uni-portal portal-id=\"article-newsletter-portal\"> <div data-component=\"uni-article-newsletter\" data-analytics-module=\"{ &quot;module_name&quot;: &quot;Newsletter&quot;, &quot;section_header&quot;: &quot;Get the latest news from Google in your inbox&quot; }\"> <h2> Get the latest news from Google in your inbox </h2> <p> Sign up for our newsletters with product updates, event information, special offers, and more. </p> <p> Your information will be used in accordance with <a href=\"https://policies.google.com/privacy\" target=\"_blank\">Google's privacy policy.</a> You may opt out at any time. </p> </div> </uni-portal> </div> </article></div>",
